&quot;                                Filter: ((name_client)::text = &#039;prime&#039;::text)&quot;
&quot;                                Rows Removed by Filter: 4581&quot;
&quot;  -&gt;  Hash  (cost=12335.35..12335.35 rows=30830 width=22) (actual time=93.097..93.097 rows=30651 loops=1)&quot;
&quot;        Buckets: 2048  Batches: 2  Memory Usage: 824kB&quot;
